{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297925","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297925","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1029792501:1":{"text":"캐롤라이나, 요즘은 어때? 여행객이나 상인들이 방해하지는 않아?","source_cn":"卡列琳娜，最近怎么样？游客和商人们没有打扰到你吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51F3D309C6BB30FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029792502:1":{"text":"루보미르는 장원 담을 넘으려는 용감한 여행객 때문에 깜짝 놀랐다 하더라고.","source_cn":"柳博米尔那边居然有胆大的游客想翻墙进去，倒是把他吓了一跳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04E2752B972E8819","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029792503:1":{"text":"응, 나도 여행객들을 만나서 이야기를 나눴어.","source_cn":"嗯，我也遇到了游客们，还稍微聊了聊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC4F1BDE92B49286","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029792504:1":{"text":"그 사람들은 유령의 집을 탐험하는 느낌이었겠지...","source_cn":"对他们来说，这里应该更接近鬼屋探险之类的感觉吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x806F704959EC34DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029792505:1":{"text":"하지만 친절한 친구도 만났고, 예쁜 손수건도 선물 받았어.","source_cn":"不过，也遇到了很友好的朋友，还送给了我漂亮的手绢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x089338ACE21B9C77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029792506:1":{"text":"자수 문양이 정말 독특하네. 색상도 아주 이쁘고.","source_cn":"这绣花看起来真是独特，用色也很大胆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA30E70FD2EE592F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029792507:1":{"text":"나중에 시간 될 때 같이 마을 구경하러 갈래?","source_cn":"既然这样，有空的时候我们一起去镇上逛逛？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6788FFCDA471A50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029792508:1":{"text":"그래도 돼? 하지만 여행객들이 놀라면...","source_cn":"可以吗？万一让游客们吓到——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99C2F57CF5110DAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029792509:1":{"text":"먼저 로드리고 일행에게 말해두면 방법이 있을 거야.","source_cn":"提前和罗德里戈他们说一声，应该总有办法的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA95455FDE2AF1C71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"발리카","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卡列琳娜":{"text":"캐롤라이나","source":"卡列琳娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}